OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas reprieve for man facing
OL,4,Adeportation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man with dementia who
OL,7,Flives in Sweden said he is "relieved"
OL,8,Fhe can spend Christmas in the country
OL,9,Fwhile a legal bid to halt deportation
OL,10,Fproceedings is considered.
OL,12,FThe Swedish authorities said they
OL,13,Fwanted George Mason, originally from
OL,14,FHinckley in Leicestershire, to leave
OL,15,Fthe country by 20 August after his
OL,16,Fapplication for permanent residency was
OL,17,Frejected.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
