OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas reprieve for man facing
OL,4,Adeportation
OL,5,
OL,6,FMason's daughter, Michelle Torossian,
OL,7,Fsaid in August the family had been told
OL,8,Fan injunction to halt his deportation
OL,9,Fwould be decided in a timeframe of two
OL,10,Fweeks to six months.
OL,12,FThe Swedish Migration Agency said in a
OL,13,Fletter to Mason that it had suspended
OL,14,Fthe enforcement of the deportation
OL,15,Fdecision until 13 January.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
